---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
<main>
  <h1 class="sr-only">Chuck Stalker — gaming persona</h1>

  <div class="wrap hero">
    <img class="greeble g-leaf" src="/images/greeble-leaf.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="384" height="152" />
    <img class="greeble g-skull" src="/images/greeble-skull.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="206" height="390" />
    <img class="greeble g-crown" src="/images/widgets/crown-skull.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="130" height="140" />
    <p class="eyebrow"><span>Precision</span><span class="dot"></span><span>Observation</span><span class="dot"></span><span>Execution</span></p>
    <picture>
      <source srcset="/images/logo-full.webp" type="image/webp" />
      <img class="lockup" src="/images/logo-full.png" alt="Chuck Stalker" width="1254" height="1254" />
    </picture>
    <p class="lede">Playing since Atari. Battlefield since 1942. Don't quote the dark magic to me, boy &mdash; I was there when it was written.</p>
    <a class="cta" href="#dossier"><span>&#9760;</span> Enter the zone <span class="arrow">&#8594;</span></a>
    <img class="widget w-abs w-shorsey" src="/images/widgets/shorsey-v3.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="164" height="100" />
  </div>

  <section id="dossier" class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="num">01</span><h2>The Dossier</h2></div>
    <div class="plate rivets dossier-card">
      <span class="rivet-tr"></span><span class="rivet-bl"></span>
      <span class="stamp">Declassified // Veteran file</span>
      <div class="dossier-body">
        <img class="widget ribbons-img" src="/images/widgets/ribbons.webp" alt="Campaign service ribbons" width="393" height="59" />
        <p><span class="callsign">SUBJECT:</span> Chuck Stalker. In continuous service since the Atari era. Enlisted in Battlefield 1942 on day one and has deployed to every theater since &mdash; wake islands, metro chokepoints, whatever the frontline is this decade.</p>
        <p class="pullquote"><img class="pq-icon" src="/images/widgets/skull-stamp.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="114" height="136" /> Dip, dip, potato chip</p>
        <p>Current postings: making offerings to RNGesus and paying to win in World of Tanks, holding objectives in Battlefield, and keeping a fully-insured fleet ready for the day Star Citizen releases. The refund window is long closed.</p>
        <p>Standing advice: Alt+F4 opens the secret loot menu. Got notes on his K/D? Give yer balls a tug.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="dogtags" src="/images/widgets/dogtags-v1.webp" alt="Dog tags: CS-75 recon unit. Born 1975, raised in the True North." width="552" height="689" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap lkp-break">
    <img class="widget lkp-standalone" src="/images/widgets/lkp-plate-v2.webp" alt="Last known position: 43.8993 N, 78.9425 W. Elevation 236 m." width="343" height="194" />
  </div>

  <section id="loadout" class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="num">02</span><h2>Loadout</h2></div>
    <img class="widget w-abs w-wheel" src="/images/widgets/wheel-snipe.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="228" height="107" />
    <div class="loadout-grid">
      <div class="plate loadout-card">
        <h3>World of Tanks</h3>
        <p>Hull down, rock hard. Bring on the lemming train &mdash; somebody has to hold the flank they all just abandoned.</p>
        <div class="pills"><span class="pill">PC</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="plate loadout-card">
        <h3>Battlefield</h3>
        <p>Enlisted in 1942. Never discharged. Still runs toward the objective while everyone else snipes from spawn.</p>
        <div class="pills"><span class="pill">PC</span><span class="pill">PS5</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="plate loadout-card">
        <h3>Star Citizen</h3>
        <p>Fleet assembled, insured, and hangar-ready. Release date: soon&trade;. The believers endure.</p>
        <div class="pills"><span class="pill">PC</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="plate loadout-card">
        <h3>First-Person Shooters</h3>
        <p>If it has iron sights and a killcam, Chuck has hours in it and opinions about it.</p>
        <div class="pills"><span class="pill">PC</span><span class="pill">PS5</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stamp-row">
      <img class="widget obj" src="/images/widgets/objectives-v1.webp" width="223" height="263" alt="Objectives: get the rocket launcher; mother on speed dial; safety squints engaged; don't get team killed; like tea bagging; rack up dem headshots; defend the objective; don't feed the enemy; nerf this!" />
      <img class="widget beaver-badge" src="/images/widgets/beaver-v2.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="121" height="127" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="gallery" class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="num">03</span><h2>Gallery</h2></div>
    <img class="widget w-abs w-stayhidden" src="/images/widgets/stay-hidden.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="220" height="67" />
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      <!-- Swap each slot for a real screenshot:
           <img src="/images/gallery/<name>.webp" alt="..." loading="lazy"> -->
      <div class="plate slot"><img class="ghost" src="/images/logo-mark.webp" alt="" /><span class="label">Awaiting footage // Slot 01</span></div>
      <div class="plate slot"><img class="ghost" src="/images/logo-mark.webp" alt="" /><span class="label">Awaiting footage // Slot 02</span></div>
      <div class="plate slot"><img class="widget squatch" src="/images/widgets/samsquanch.webp" alt="" /><span class="label">Footage inconclusive // Samsquanch</span></div>
      <div class="plate slot"><img class="ghost" src="/images/logo-mark.webp" alt="" /><span class="label">Awaiting footage // Slot 04</span></div>
      <div class="plate slot"><img class="widget seen" src="/images/widgets/you-were-seen.webp" alt="" /><span class="label">Evidence pending // Slot 05</span></div>
      <div class="plate slot"><img class="ghost" src="/images/logo-mark.webp" alt="" /><span class="label">Awaiting footage // Slot 06</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap tooclose-break">
    <img class="widget tooclose-standalone" src="/images/widgets/tooclose-v2.webp" alt="If you can read this, you are too close." width="180" height="194" />
  </div>

  <section id="comms" class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="num">04</span><h2>Comms</h2></div>
    <div class="comms-row">
      <img class="widget w-callsign" src="/images/widgets/callsign.webp" alt="Callsign: Stalker. Reconnaissance is an art, not a job." width="223" height="120" />
      <div class="comms-grid">
        <!-- TODO: real profile URLs + handles -->
        <a class="plate comm" href="#"><span class="svc">Steam</span><span class="handle">Callsign pending</span></a>
        <a class="plate comm" href="#"><span class="svc">PlayStation</span><span class="handle">Callsign pending</span></a>
        <a class="plate comm" href="#"><span class="svc">Discord</span><span class="handle">Callsign pending</span></a>
      </div>
      <img class="widget w-freq" src="/images/widgets/freq-plate-v2.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="174" height="104" />
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Layout>
